msgid ""
"Exclude file or directory paths from within the backed-up volumes (passed as"
" rsync/borg --exclude patterns).<br/>This does NOT exclude compose files "
"from the job - use Exclude filter above for that.<br/>e.g. *.log, tmp/*, "
"cache/<br/>Separate multiple patterns with commas."
